    scaled source blocks painted in output must not overlap each other or existing marker squares
    clipping allowed -- painted blocks may extend to grid edge and be clipped [observed]
  output:
    same grid size; for each instance, paint each template source cell as a k x k block of source color at (origin + rel * k); template and markers preserved

generation_strategy:
